        "duration": 35.52000045776367,
        "text": "This AI relationship coaching platform is gaining traction. AI is transforming the landscape of relationship counseling, according to experts. CoupleWork, co-founded by experienced couples counselor Clay Cockrell, leverages AI to provide relationship coaching. With a significant number of users turning to AI for emotional support, the platform aims to address unique challenges of modern relationships. Cockrell emphasizes the potential of AI to enhance human connections, although he learns that not all current implementations are beneficial. The platform seeks to harness AI's capability to improve relationship dynamics effectively.",
